# The corpus image needs only the corpus itself and #9's harness client.
# Keeping the build context to these two trees makes the context transfer
# small (the repository root holds node_modules, build output, and .git).
# BuildKit and Finch both honour this Dockerfile-specific ignore file.
*
!tests
!harness
**/__pycache__
**/.receipts
**/.definitions*
**/node_modules
